Hereby I am declaring my candidacy for the Technical Committee.

My involvement with OpenStack began in 2014 and I've since become core
reviewer for a number of projects, including Designate, Devstack and
Kolla/Kolla-Ansible. I'm also helping out with the Release and
Requirements teams.

Since 2018 I'm also a member of what is now called the OpenDev infra
root team, trying to keep the CI setup and supporting infrastructure
working.

I have been serving for some time now as a TC member and I hope
to be able to continue with that if I am elected once again.

